{
  "server": "en",
  "storyId": "1stact_level_a001_04_beg",
  "groupId": "1stact",
  "stageId": "a001_04",
  "title": "Turn State's Evidence",
  "storyCode": "GT-4",
  "avgTag": "Before Operation",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/en/gamedata/story/activities/a001/level_a001_04_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "ae8f20d48b8830fb46562e750c7ed8380e1dedca089ec0c1708dc81ff31ab205",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "第四关（前）\nClear \\ Visibility: 14 km\nMt. Terrat tunnel"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Big Bob",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_010",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "We'll be safe after we enter this tunnel. At the other end of this tunnel is Mt. Mortica, which won't have very many bounty hunters."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Big Bob",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_010",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "As for that Skadi... I used to scoff at those rumors that described her as a living avalanche. Turns out, I learned the truth today."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Big Bob",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_010",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I was expecting her to be a bit stronger than your average shmuck, but those rumors turned out to not be exaggerated after all."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Big Bob",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_010",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "No wonder why the guys at the bar always looked at me like I'm crazy when I laughed at them for being terrified of her."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Big Bob",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_010",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Now it's my turn to be terrified, hah."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Grani",
      "speakerToken": "char_220_grani#4",
      "operatorId": "char_220_grani",
      "portraitKey": "char_220_grani",
      "text": "It's true! I heard those same rumors going around in Rhodes Island too."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Grani",
      "speakerToken": "char_220_grani#4",
      "operatorId": "char_220_grani",
      "portraitKey": "char_220_grani",
      "text": "I've also never been sent on a mission with her before. I knew that she was really powerful, but I never expected this to happen..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Grani",
      "speakerToken": "char_220_grani#4",
      "operatorId": "char_220_grani",
      "portraitKey": "char_220_grani",
      "text": "I didn't even know that she was a bounty hunter before."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Big Bob",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_010",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "She's one of the most infamous bounty hunters out there."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Big Bob",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_010",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Now that she's also after the treasure, we're going to have our work cut out for us."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Big Bob",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_010",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I have no idea if the two of us will be able to beat her to it."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Carol",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_003",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "If that's the case, does that mean my village..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Big Bob",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_010",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Don't worry. I think she'll drive the rest of the bounty hunters away."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Big Bob",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_010",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Though... she might destroy a few villages in the process."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Carol",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_003",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Ugh..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Grani",
      "speakerToken": "char_220_grani#5",
      "operatorId": "char_220_grani",
      "portraitKey": "char_220_grani",
      "text": "I don't think she's here for the treasure. I can't let something like that happen."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Big Bob",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_010",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "So, your Rhodes Island or whatever, will hire just about anyone?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Grani",
      "speakerToken": "char_220_grani#5",
      "operatorId": "char_220_grani",
      "portraitKey": "char_220_grani",
      "text": "No Rhodes Island operator would ever harm others recklessly for their own selfish gain."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Big Bob",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_010",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Hmph. Well, you seem nice enough, and even did me a favor. However, the fact that your Rhodes Island is enabling Skadi, an entity who knows only destruction, makes me question whether your organization truly seeks to help the Infected."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Big Bob",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_010",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Furthermore, as someone stricken with Oripathy, I've never seen Rhodes Island do anything to help those like me. We're still abused wherever we go."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Grani",
      "speakerToken": "char_220_grani#4",
      "operatorId": "char_220_grani",
      "portraitKey": "char_220_grani",
      "text": "Big Bob..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Big Bob",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_010",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "What, got nothing to say to that? Honestly, I have no idea why you have so much faith in an organization like that."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Big Bob",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_010",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "As far as I can tell, their claim of wanting to help the Infected is just lip service. In the end, all they see is money."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Big Bob",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_010",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Hmph, what's the deal with Rhodes Island anyway? In this world, there's nothing that speaks louder than the coins in my hand!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Grani",
      "speakerToken": "char_220_grani#4",
      "operatorId": "char_220_grani",
      "portraitKey": "char_220_grani",
      "text": "Sorry..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Big Bob",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_010",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "What are you apologizing for? You're still a kid, and you still can't tell between ideals and reality, nor do you know your worth. But all of this is perfectly normal."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Grani",
      "speakerToken": "char_220_grani#4",
      "operatorId": "char_220_grani",
      "portraitKey": "char_220_grani",
      "text": "No, that's not what I meant. I know that I'm still lacking."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Grani",
      "speakerToken": "char_220_grani#4",
      "operatorId": "char_220_grani",
      "portraitKey": "char_220_grani",
      "text": "It's just that... whether as a police officer, or as an operator, I've met a lot of Infected."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Grani",
      "speakerToken": "char_220_grani#4",
      "operatorId": "char_220_grani",
      "portraitKey": "char_220_grani",
      "text": "...I wasn't able to save them all, because I was lacking."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Grani",
      "speakerToken": "char_220_grani#4",
      "operatorId": "char_220_grani",
      "portraitKey": "char_220_grani",
      "text": "Rhodes Island is the same."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Big Bob",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_010",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "In other words, they're useless? Hah!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Big Bob",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_010",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "That's right. When the Infected were slaving away underground, locked away in remote places, or being killed for no reason, where was Rhodes Island?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Grani",
      "speakerToken": "char_220_grani#4",
      "operatorId": "char_220_grani",
      "portraitKey": "char_220_grani",
      "text": "Even when we try our hardest, we sometimes still come up short. That's true for both me and for Rhodes Island."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Grani",
      "speakerToken": "char_220_grani#5",
      "operatorId": "char_220_grani",
      "portraitKey": "char_220_grani",
      "text": "Despite that, I'll never give up on any innocent Infected who I see."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Grani",
      "speakerToken": "char_220_grani#5",
      "operatorId": "char_220_grani",
      "portraitKey": "char_220_grani",
      "text": "Rhodes Island is the same."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Big Bob",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_010",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Tch."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Grani",
      "speakerToken": "char_220_grani#4",
      "operatorId": "char_220_grani",
      "portraitKey": "char_220_grani",
      "text": "Sorry, Big Bob..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Big Bob",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_010",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "...I told you, you're just a kid. What good does it do to hammer you with my grievances?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Big Bob",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_010",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "But that Skadi, your coworker, would not hesitate to point her weapon at you, or abduct Carol to seize the treasure."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Big Bob",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_010",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Can you say with confidence that someone like that would share your ideals and work with you to help the Infected?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Grani",
      "speakerToken": "char_220_grani#5",
      "operatorId": "char_220_grani",
      "portraitKey": "char_220_grani",
      "text": "I don't know what Skadi plans on doing, so I can't answer that."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Grani",
      "speakerToken": "char_220_grani#5",
      "operatorId": "char_220_grani",
      "portraitKey": "char_220_grani",
      "text": "However, I trust that if Rhodes Island took her in, then she must have her reasons."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Big Bob",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_010",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "You can forget my rambling then. I overstepped my bounds."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Grani",
      "speakerToken": "char_220_grani#5",
      "operatorId": "char_220_grani",
      "portraitKey": "char_220_grani",
      "text": "It's okay."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Grani",
      "speakerToken": "char_220_grani#5",
      "operatorId": "char_220_grani",
      "portraitKey": "char_220_grani",
      "text": "Anyway, our priority right now is to help Miss Carol find the treasure."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Big Bob",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_010",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I'm just dead weight now, with this injured leg. Heh, I never thought I'd be the one burdening two little girls."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Grani",
      "speakerToken": "char_220_grani#5",
      "operatorId": "char_220_grani",
      "portraitKey": "char_220_grani",
      "text": "Big Bob, we'll only consider you a burden on one condition..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Grani",
      "speakerToken": "char_220_grani#5",
      "operatorId": "char_220_grani",
      "portraitKey": "char_220_grani",
      "text": "...and that's if you don't plan on sharing the treasure with us."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Big Bob",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_010",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Oh? Hahaha!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Carol",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_003",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Mister Bob, I wasn't disgusted by your condition. It's just that... I was a bit scared."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Carol",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_003",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I'm from the sticks, and I haven't seen many Infected people. But even I can tell... that you've endured a lot of hardship."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Carol",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_003",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I apologize if I was rude to you before."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Big Bob",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_010",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Don't worry about it. Heh, as long as we find the treasure and you get me my share, I'll be a happy camper."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Carol",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_003",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Mhm... The treasure is important to our village, but we only need enough to resolve our problems. Mister Bob, you'll be able to get your fair share."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Carol",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_003",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "That's why Grani and I need help, and will aid you as well."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Carol",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_003",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Right, Grani?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Grani",
      "speakerToken": "char_220_grani#3",
      "operatorId": "char_220_grani",
      "portraitKey": "char_220_grani",
      "text": "Of course. In any case, we need to get moving soon."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Big Bob",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_010",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Our next destination should be Mt. Mortica. That mountain was named after some knight who died long ago."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Big Bob",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_010",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "If my intuition is correct, then that should be where the treasure is located, right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Carol",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_003",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "However, there are a lot of caves up ahead. It'd take an average person weeks to search them all."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Big Bob",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_010",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Of course. That's why we can't do this without you. There's no way we're going to hand you to that red-eyed woman."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Carol",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_003",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Please lead the way then."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Big Bob",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_010",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Sounds like a plan."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Big Bob",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_010",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Wait a moment."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Big Bob",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_010",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "There's some movement near the tunnel's exit..."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Aaaagh—"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "'Captain'",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_008",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Someone... help... save me..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "'Captain'",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_008",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "It's... the Infected..."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Reunion Member A",
      "speakerToken": "char_1002_nsabr_2",
      "operatorId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "portraitKey": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "text": "...What'd you do to him?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Reunion Member B",
      "speakerToken": "char_1002_nsabr_1",
      "operatorId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "portraitKey": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "text": "I didn't even do anything. He just tripped over himself..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Reunion Member B",
      "speakerToken": "char_1002_nsabr_1",
      "operatorId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "portraitKey": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "text": "Huh."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Reunion Member A",
      "speakerToken": "char_1002_nsabr_2",
      "operatorId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "portraitKey": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "text": "..."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Grani",
      "speakerToken": "char_220_grani#5",
      "operatorId": "char_220_grani",
      "portraitKey": "char_220_grani",
      "text": "They're... from Reunion?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Big Bob",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_010",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "You guys..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Grani",
      "speakerToken": "char_220_grani#5",
      "operatorId": "char_220_grani",
      "portraitKey": "char_220_grani",
      "text": "Big Bob, what are you doing?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Grani",
      "speakerToken": "char_220_grani#5",
      "operatorId": "char_220_grani",
      "portraitKey": "char_220_grani",
      "text": "These guys aren't your ordinary..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Big Bob",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_010",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Say no more. We're going to have to fight!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Reunion Member",
      "speakerToken": "char_1002_nsabr_2",
      "operatorId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "portraitKey": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "text": "..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Reunion Member",
      "speakerToken": "char_1002_nsabr_2",
      "operatorId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "portraitKey": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "text": "Quick, capture them before they get away!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
  "observedOperators": [
    {
